OL,3,GNEWSATourism leaders in new alliance to
OL,4,Aboost visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FTourism leaders in Cornwall have set up
OL,7,Fa new organisation to champion the
OL,8,Fcounty's visitor economy after it lost
OL,9,Fits official tourism board.
OL,11,FThe Cornwall Visitor Alliance said it
OL,12,Fwould work as an independent,
OL,13,Fnot-for-profit company to help market
OL,14,FCornwall to visitors, represent
OL,15,Fbusinesses and carry out strategic
OL,16,Fpartnerships.
OL,18,FIt comes after Visit Cornwall went into
OL,19,Fliquidation last autumn, prompting
OL,20,Fmembers of the tourism sector to
OL,21,Fdevelop the new model.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
