OL,3,GNEWSATourism leaders in new alliance to
OL,4,Aboost visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Preece, Cornwall Council's
OL,7,Fcabinet member for tourism, said: "The
OL,8,FCornwall Visitor Alliance company can
OL,9,Fnow begin its journey as a private
OL,10,Forganisation, leading the delivery of a
OL,11,Fsustainable and thriving visitor
OL,12,Feconomy for Cornwall."
